## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical multi-task learning under streaming constraints, including feature hashing, online updates, drift detection, calibration, and retraining cadence.

## Key Concepts

- Multi-task learning with shared representations
- Online learning with partial_fit
- Feature hashing for high-cardinality categoricals
- Drift detection (PSI, drift in AUC)
- Latency and memory constraints, calibration

